    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0001",
      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0009",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "The following example sets the adaptive visibility for the compass and scale, and hides the map type and zoom controls:",
      "normalizedSource": "The following example sets the adaptive visibility for the compass and scale, and hides the map type and zoom controls:",
      "sourceHash": "d092cb94f3c4e2d0907ea4cfdfff6b57f75280d51d5a1bfc96f7cd1d5b1268bc",
      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "You can show or hide controls that aren’t adaptive by setting map properties to `true` or `false`, respectively.",
      "contextAfter": "```javascript\n// Create a map.\nconst map = new mapkit.Map(\"my-map-element-id\");\n\n// Show the compass only when the rotation is actively changing.\nmap.showsCompass = mapkit.FeatureVisibility.Adaptive;\n\n// Show the scale only when the zoom level is actively changing.\nmap.showsScale = mapkit.FeatureVisibility.Adaptive;\n\n// Hide the map type and zoom controls.\nmap.showsMapTypeControl = false;\nmap.showsZoomControl = false;\n```",
      "documentTitle": "Adaptive",
      "framework": "MapKitJS",
      "ko": "",
      "status": "failed",
      "reviewed": false,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:code:discussion:0010:0001",
      "blockId": "code:discussion:0010",
      "type": "preserve",
      "source": "```javascript\n// Create a map.\nconst map = new mapkit.Map(\"my-map-element-id\");\n\n// Show the compass only when the rotation is actively changing.\nmap.showsCompass = mapkit.FeatureVisibility.Adaptive;\n\n// Show the scale only when the zoom level is actively changing.\nmap.showsScale = mapkit.FeatureVisibility.Adaptive;\n\n// Hide the map type and zoom controls.\nmap.showsMapTypeControl = false;\nmap.showsZoomControl = false;\n```",
      "normalizedSource": "```javascript // Create a map. const map = new mapkit.Map(\"my-map-element-id\"); // Show the compass only when the rotation is actively changing. map.showsCompass = mapkit.FeatureVisibility.Adaptive; // Show the scale only when the zoom level is actively changing. map.showsScale = mapkit.FeatureVisibility.Adaptive; // Hide the map type and zoom controls. map.showsMapTypeControl = false; map.showsZoomControl = false; ```",
      "sourceHash": "c50de453319f581ed3a1a84276af868f44167d643ce72779ca29b1ccefa52d44",
      "translatable": false,
      "preserveReason": "code",
      "contextBefore": "The following example sets the adaptive visibility for the compass and scale, and hides the map type and zoom controls:",
      "contextAfter": "See Also",
      "documentTitle": "Adaptive",
      "framework": "MapKitJS",
      "ko": "```javascript\n// Create a map.\nconst map = new mapkit.Map(\"my-map-element-id\");\n\n// Show the compass only when the rotation is actively changing.\nmap.showsCompass = mapkit.FeatureVisibility.Adaptive;\n\n// Show the scale only when the zoom level is actively changing.\nmap.showsScale = mapkit.FeatureVisibility.Adaptive;\n\n// Hide the map type and zoom controls.\nmap.showsMapTypeControl = false;\nmap.showsZoomControl = false;\n```",
      "status": "preserved",
      "reviewed": false,
      "locked": true
    },
